308
00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.560
And on and on it goes.

309
00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.570
- That's foul.

310
00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.570
- It's beyond foul.

311
00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:40.470
All the other wildlings

312
00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:40.470
