316
00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.510
He marries his daughters.

317
00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.480
What does he do with his sons?

318
00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:01.090
He said he planned to stop here

319
00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:01.090
