320
00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:02.760
People make all sorts of plans.

321
00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:06.200
I haven't seen Benjen Stark in three years.

322
00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:07.700
Haven't missed him.

323
