Always treated me like scum.

324
00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.470
Haven't had any good wine for a long time.

325
00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.380
You Southerners make good wine.

326
00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.380
I'll give you that.

327
00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.410
We're not Southerners.

328
00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.070
Who's this little girl?

329
00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:25.450
You're prettier than half my daughters.

330
00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:28.820
You got a nice wet twat between your legs?

331
00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:30.650
What's your name?

332
00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.660
- Jon Snow.

333
00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.660
- Snow. eh?

334
00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.660
Listen to me. bastard.

335
00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:39.700
