397
00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:22.390
A roof would be welcome.

398
00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:23.900
It's been hard riding.

399
00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:27.200
We've brought our own food

400
00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:27.200
