405
00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:47.720
Your roof. your rules.

406
00:24:00.730 --> 00:24:02.400
Who am I?

407
00:24:03.200 --> 00:24:06.610
- Who am I?

408
00:24:03.200 --> 00:24:06.610
- Lord Commander.

409
00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.770
