410
00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.770
- Jon Snow.

411
00:24:09.840 --> 00:24:11.240
Who are you?

412
00:24:12.710 --> 00:24:14.180
Your steward.

413
00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:16.670
