417
00:24:48.280 --> 00:24:51.120
Take them and cast your light upon us.

418
00:24:52.920 --> 00:24:56.220
for the night is dark and full of terrors.

419
00:24:57.090 --> 00:25:00.260
For the night is dark and full of terrors.

420
00:25:02.630 --> 00:25:04.560
After the long summer.

421
00:25:04.630 --> 00:25:07.500
darkness will fall heavy on the world.

422
00:25:07.570 --> 00:25:10.160
The stars will bleed.

423
00:25:10.340 --> 00:25:12.860
We need to stop her.

424
00:25:12.940 --> 00:25:16.710
The cold breath of winter

425
00:25:12.940 --> 00:25:16.710
