434
00:25:50.640 --> 00:25:52.200
Do you want to stop me?

435
00:25:56.850 --> 00:25:58.580
Stop me.

436
00:26:11.600 --> 00:26:13.290
In the ancient books. it's written

437
00:26:13.370 --> 00:26:17.070
