493
00:29:35.540 --> 00:29:37.700
The time has come to choose.

494
00:29:38.470 --> 00:29:40.870
Let no man claim ignorance as an excuse.

495
00:29:40.940 --> 00:29:43.470
Your Grace. the Lannisters are

496
00:29:40.940 --> 00:29:43.470
