501
00:29:47.880 --> 00:29:49.680
Well. many have already declared for him.

502
00:29:49.750 --> 00:29:51.980
Mace Tyrell. Randyll Tarly.

503
00:29:52.050 --> 00:29:55.250
Stannis does not need

504
00:29:52.050 --> 00:29:55.250
