525
00:30:35.530 --> 00:30:37.000
Don't.

526
00:30:37.530 --> 00:30:42.090
A cup of wine to honor the one true god.

527
00:31:28.480 --> 00:31:31.650
The night is dark and full of terrors. old man.

528
00:31:31.720 --> 00:31:34.780
but the fire burns them all away.

529
00:32:09.920 --> 00:32:11.820
King in the North.

530
00:32:14.590 --> 00:32:18.330
I keep expecting you to leave me

531
00:32:14.590 --> 00:32:18.330
