Never.

836
00:47:20.800 --> 00:47:22.790
That will be all. Mother.

837
00:47:29.680 --> 00:47:31.640
No. no. no. no.

838
00:47:31.710 --> 00:47:34.550
Do you have any idea

839
00:47:31.710 --> 00:47:34.550
how ridiculous you sound?

840
00:47:34.610 --> 00:47:36.050
Ease into it.

841
00:47:36.120 --> 00:47:39.110
Slowly. with passion.

842
00:47:41.420 --> 00:47:42.750
Oh. yeah.

843
00:47:44.020 --> 00:47:46.790
Go wash yourselves. Put some clothes on.

844
00:47:46.860 --> 00:47:49.350
Both of you are working tonight.

845
00:47:53.300 --> 00:47:55.200
We do things differently here. Daisy.

846
00:47:55.270 --> 00:47:59.170
This isn't some five-copper

847
00:47:55.270 --> 00:47:59.170
bawdy house in Hayseed Hall.

848
00:47:59.240 --> 00:48:01.830
- Haystack Hall.

849
00:47:59.240 --> 00:48:01.830
- Wherever you're from.

850
00:48:01.910 --> 00:48:06.400
Our establishment doesn't cater

851
00:48:01.910 --> 00:48:06.400
to plowmen and goat herders.

852
00:48:06.480 --> 00:48:08.210
Lord Olsen.

853
00:48:08.280 --> 00:48:10.250
Taste is everything here.

854
00:48:10.320 --> 00:48:12.250
Littlefinger's a fancy man.

855
00:48:12.320 --> 00:48:13.950
Don't call him Littlefinger.

856
00:48:14.020 --> 00:48:15.450
He doesn't like it.

857
00:48:15.520 --> 00:48:17.850
Lord Baelish.

858
00:48:23.700 --> 00:48:25.690
She pretends she doesn't

859
00:48:23.700 --> 00:48:25.690
speak the common tongue

860
00:48:25.770 --> 00:48:28.360
so that people will think she's exotic.

861
00:48:28.430 --> 00:48:31.270
She grew up just down the road

862
00:48:28.430 --> 00:48:31.270
in Flea Bottom.

863
00:48:31.340 --> 00:48:33.810
She's beautiful.

864
00:48:33.870 --> 00:48:37.140
She's a dumb slut. really.

865
00:48:33.870 --> 00:48:37.140
but a lid for every pot.

866
00:48:42.250 --> 00:48:44.550
Lord Commander.

867
00:48:44.620 --> 00:48:47.450
Good to see you again.

868
00:49:02.470 --> 00:49:06.530
You do realize this establishment

869
00:49:02.470 --> 00:49:06.530
is owned by Lord Petyr Baelish.

870
00:49:06.610 --> 00:49:08.800
the King's Master of Coin.

871
00:49:08.870 --> 00:49:10.670
Coin which goes in many pockets.

872
00:49:11.210 --> 00:49:13.410
- Orders.

873
00:49:11.210 --> 00:49:13.410
- Whose orders?

874
00:49:13.480 --> 00:49:16.240
Someone who doesn't care

875
00:49:13.480 --> 00:49:16.240
what Littlefinger thinks.

876
00:49:34.170 --> 00:49:37.140
No. you can't. No! Please!

877
00:49:37.940 --> 00:49:40.370
No! Not my Barra!

878
00:49:40.440 --> 00:49:43.880
- Please. Please.

879
00:49:40.440 --> 00:49:43.880
- Enough. Get it done.

880
00:49:43.940 --> 00:49:45.840
- Kill the bastard.

881
00:49:43.940 --> 00:49:45.840
- No. no!

882
00:49:45.910 --> 00:49:48.310
- Please.

883
00:49:45.910 --> 00:49:48.310
- Give it here.

884
00:49:48.380 --> 00:49:50.580
No. please.

885
00:50:00.960 --> 00:50:03.260
Spread out. Search every house.

886
00:50:03.330 --> 00:50:05.590
Every room. Look in every room.

887
00:50:30.260 --> 00:50:32.730
Gendry! His name is Gendry.

888
00:50:32.790 --> 00:50:34.520
Where is the bastard?

889
00:50:34.590 --> 00:50:37.190
The Night's Watch! Please. stop!

890
00:50:37.260 --> 00:50:38.700
Where?

891
00:50:38.860 --> 00:50:41.730
They took him up the Kingsroad.

892
00:50:38.860 --> 00:50:41.730
heading north.

893
00:50:41.800 --> 00:50:45.360
- How will we know him?

894
00:50:41.800 --> 00:50:45.360
- He's got a bull's head helmet.

895
00:50:45.470 --> 00:50:48.310
- He made it himself.

896
00:50:45.470 --> 00:50:48.310
- Find him.
